    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"stop everything\"? it just feels like no matter what i do, the noise never actually stops. even when i'm technically \"off,\" my head is still running those numbers and worrying about the next quarter. it's like there's no actual silence left in my life.",
